猫叔的图 (Maoshu Photos)
========================

This program is a fork of Lap, an open-source local photo manager.

Upstream project
----------------
    Name:       Lap - Private Local Photo Manager
    Author:     julyx10 <tiangle@gmail.com>
    Repository: https://github.com/julyx10/lap
    License:    GNU General Public License v3.0 or later

Copyright
---------
    Copyright (C) 2025-2026 julyx10 and the Lap contributors
    Copyright (C) 2026 the 猫叔的图 contributors

This fork keeps the upstream engine — media indexing, thumbnail generation,
RAW decoding, EXIF parsing, CLIP semantic search, face detection and
clustering, duplicate detection, and the SQLite library schema — and adds a
distinct interface and an additional workflow layer on top of it.

